        "original_id": "c63c4fac-b295-5c97-8d7f-eadc831c5616",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Glenn Hughes, Dave Evans\n- Bands: Trapeze, Deep Purple, Black Sabbath, AC/DC\n- Products: From Now On...\n- Roles: bassist, vocalist, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Glenn Hughes was born on 21 August 1951 and is an English rock bassist and vocalist.\n- Dave Evans was born on 20 July 1953 and is an Australian singer.\n- Dave Evans briefly sang for AC/DC from 1973 to 1974.\n- Glenn Hughes is best known for playing bass and performing vocals for Trapeze and for Deep Purple’s Mk. lineups.\n- From Now On... is a solo studio album by Glenn Hughes.\n- Glenn Hughes was previously a bassist and vocalist for Deep Purple, Black Sabbath, and Trapeze.",
